  // figure below is read from the committed
  // backend/scripts/band_structure_measured.json and pasted verbatim, none is
  // typed here; the page itself still takes its verdict from
  // band_structure.MEASURED, never from this file. The coverage sentence was
  // re-checked against the renderers (BandStructureChip mounts on all ten row
  // boards — Session, HotPullback, Patterns, SignalLab, Overnight, Hottest,
  // Bonde, Gnt, ExplosiveGrowth, Catalysts; the eight tile tabs get it through
  // PatternChart; the six n/a tabs render the served n/a line and are not
